      "value": "Person on make public instance is usally random, if person just clicks join in world window its world creator, so a side of him which can be part of the group, group owners will have problem equiring the control of the instance (btw for them Group Publics been made and groups use those to moderate instance as it's more reliable), there also nothing stoping you to create your own public instance which in popular worlds will be populated very fast.",
